---
/* Any address the site has no page for: the shell, carrying no item of its own,
   reads the address instead. A book's page it opens as a tab, which says what
   is missing; anything else lands on the about page. Like the front of the
   site, it boots on no book. */
import ShellPage from '../layouts/ShellPage.astro';
---
<ShellPage
  pool=""
  title="Not found · OmniStax"
  description="There is no page at this address."
/>
